11
01:12:52,500 --> 01:12:58,500
It was filmed in the Kootenay region of Southeastern
British Columbia and stars Jessica Biel.

12
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
The film is set in a small former mining town where poverty is rife
and children are disappearing on a regular basis.

13
01:26:07,500 --> 01:26:13,500
The abductions are blamed on a local legend called "the Tall Man".

14
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:51,000
Jessica Biel plays a widowed nurse whose child is abducted,
leading her on a desperate chase to recover him.

15
